OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fcoastal showers will come and go, but
OL,7,Fremaining dry inland. Clear spells in
OL,8,Fthe south under which frost and fog
OL,9,Fwill develop. Cold and cloudy further
OL,10,Fnortheast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FAny fog will lift through the
OL,13,Fmorning to bring long spells of
OL,14,Fsunshine. Cloudier spells further
OL,15,Fnorth, but for all it will feel cool,
OL,16,Fcalm and autumnal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
