OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,6,Ffoggy, frosty and bright morning on
OL,7,FMonday, before cloud thickens. Cloudy
OL,8,Fand breezy with spells of rain during
OL,9,FTuesday and Wednesday, but
OL,10,Ftemperatures will be milder than
OL,11,Fprevious days.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
